(*   - THE SPECIMEN REMOVED, second form -- `qsiteV`'s payload changed *)
(*     to `FI 7`:  REJECTED at line 24153, in the same guard, for the  *)
(*     same reason.                                                    *)
(*   - `guard_padm_refuses_a_changed_answer`'s index 2 changed to      *)
